#: ../source/models/builtin/llm/minimax-m3.1-flash.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Description:** MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a native multimodal Mixture-of-Experts model "
"with 428B total parameters, 23B activated parameters and a 1M-token context window. "
"It uses sparse attention throughout and quantization-aware training with MXFP8 dense "
"layers and NVFP4 experts."
msgstr ""
"**描述:** MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 是原生多模态混合专家模型，总参数量为 4280 亿，激活参数量为 230 亿，上下文窗口为 100 万 "
"token。它在所有层中使用稀疏注意力，并采用量化感知训练，包含 MXFP8 稠密层和 NVFP4 专家。"

